    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{21}{20}$",
      "worked": "The side adjacent to $\\theta$ is the vertical side.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\mathrm{Adj}&=\\sqrt{29^2-20^2}\\\\&=\\sqrt{441}\\\\&=21\\\\\\cot\\theta&=\\frac{\\mathrm{Adj}}{\\mathrm{Opp}}\\\\&=\\frac{21}{20}.\\end{align*}$$",
